          "text": "Then he said, “These are the two men whom God has chosen and anointed to serve him, the Lord of the whole earth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
