          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “Zerubbabel has laid the foundation of the Temple, and he will finish the building. When this happens, my people will know that it is I who sent you to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are disappointed because so little progress is being made. But they will see Zerubbabel continuing to build the Temple, and they will be glad.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
